# The build context for control-plane/deploy/Dockerfile, which is the only
# image this repository builds.
#
# Deny first, then name what the provisioner is made of. The other order was not
# an option worth having: an allowlist that starts from "everything" ships the
# UI, the agent SDK, the site and 1.2 GB of node_modules the moment somebody
# adds a directory.
#
# Measured 2026-08-11: control-plane/ is 903 MB, control-plane/web is 901 MB of
# it, .git is 52 MB, the root node_modules is 1.2 GB. What is left after these
# rules is about 1.7 MB. control-plane/deploy/image.test.ts holds the intent.
*
!control-plane
!deploy
deploy/*
!deploy/install.sh
control-plane/web
**/node_modules
**/*.test.ts
